    ".POBJ",
    "Photo Pos Pro Vector Object File",
    "3.7",
    "Vector object file used by Photo Pos Pro, a freeware photo and graphics editor for Windows; similar to a clipart graphic and saves a vector image that can be inserted into a Photo Pos Pro drawing or page layout document. Photo Pos Pro vector objects can be accessed by selecting Tools → Add/Browse Objects.. from the application menu. Windows Power Of Software Photo Pos Pro.",
