    "Vector image created with FreeHand drawing software; uses points, lines, and curves to create images that can be scaled with no loss of quality; FreeHand, which was originally developed by Macromedia, was discontinued by Adobe in 2007. NOTE: Adobe Illustrator CS2 and later can open FreeHand 9 files. Windows Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023. Adobe Flash Professional CC —  (Discontinued). Trial Mac Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023. Adobe Flash Professional CC —  (Discontinued). Trial.",
