    "FreeHand 5 Drawing File",
    "3.0",
    "Image file created by FreeHand, a vector image drawing application; similar to.FH4,.FH6, and.FH7 files; contains a FreeHand version 5 project; uses lines, points, and curves to create images that can be scaled with no quality loss. NOTE: FreeHand was phased out in 2007. It was originally developed by Macromedia then acquired by Adobe in 2005. Mac Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023. Windows Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023.",
