    "The Logo Creator File",
    "3.0",
    "A TLC file is a logo created with Laughingbird Software The Logo Creator, a graphics program designed for creating and editing logos. It typically contains vector graphics and text. TLC files may also include textures, 2D and 3D effects, and a transparent or colored background. Windows Laughingbird The Logo Creator —  (Discontinued). Mac Laughingbird The Logo Creator —  (Discontinued).",
