    ".FH6",
    "FreeHand 6 Drawing File",
    "3.0",
    "File created by FreeHand, a vector image drawing program; contains a FreeHand version 6 project; uses lines, points, and curves to create images that can be scaled with no loss of quality; used most often for professional illustration and web content creation; similar to.FH5,.FH7, and.FH8 files. NOTE: FreeHand was originally developed by Macromedia, acquired by Adobe, then phased out in 2007 and is no longer maintained. Windows Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023. Mac Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023.",
    "Windows Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023. Mac Adobe FreeHand. Adobe Illustrator 2023.",
