    "HyperSnap Drawing",
    "3.0",
    "Image created by HyperSnap screen capture and annotation software; stores a screen capture image as well as drawn shapes, such as callouts and arrows; allows the image and shapes to be saved and re-edited before rasterizing the final image. DHS files can be saved to various output formats, including.JPG,.PNG,.BMP,.GIF.EMF,.TIF, and.PDF. Windows Hyperionics HyperSnap.",
