    "Drawing created by Artboard, a vector illustration program for Mac; saves the drawing in either a binary or plain XML plist (.PLIST) format, depending on the users save option; usually is contained within an.ARTB package. NOTE: While DRAWING files store the actual drawing created in Artboard, ARTB files are used as the save and load format and contain the DRAWING file. Mac Mapdiva Artboard —  (Discontinued). Trial.",
