    "Clarify Document",
    "3.0",
    "Document created by Clarify, a program used for creating and annotating screen shots; saves captured images as well as text, shapes, and other visual annotations; used for making tutorials and illustrations and can be shared via email or Dropbox. Clarify documents can also be exported as.PDF files for sharing. NOTE: Blue Mango Clarify was discontinued in February 2018. Mac Blue Mango Clarify —  (Discontinued).",
