    ".DESIGN",
    "Microsoft Expression Design Drawing",
    "2.5",
    "Drawing created with Microsoft Expression Design, a drawing and design program for Windows; may contain both vector and raster graphics; can also include multiple layers and various image effects. Microsoft Expression Design is part of the Microsoft Expression Studio suite. However, Microsoft discontinued Expression Studio in 2012. Windows Microsoft Expression Studio —  (Discontinued).",
